        "needs": [
          "a pen and something to write on",
          "your eyes, for letter shapes on the page"
        ],
        "waitUntilStopped": [
          "Script — one sign"
        ],
        "text": "Before we start: this one needs your hands, so it is not a driving lesson. You will want a pen and something to write on and your eyes, for letter shapes on the page. You can listen to everything else now — leave the section called Script — one sign until you have stopped, and I will say so again when we reach it."
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "type": "warmup",
          "title": "Warm-up",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 20,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 20s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Say flatbread, recall the three-word transport payoff, then write hand."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "script",
          "title": "Script — one sign",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ट — ṭa."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A single closed loop hanging under the headline. Set it beside the ठ of ठेला: ठ carries a second inner ring and a puff of breath, ट (ṭa) has neither."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Trace ट (ṭa) once. Copy it once. Write ठ beside it and say which one has the extra ring. Cover both, wait five seconds, and write ट (ṭa) from the curled sound cue."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "recall",
          "title": "Wrap-up Recall",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Source: Unicode Devanagari chart."
            },
            {
              "kind": "activity",
              "scored": true,
              "id": "MW-W19-tta-write",
              "prompt": "Write the unaspirated curled Devanagari ta.",
              "assesses": [
                "MW-SCRIPT-TTA-01"
              ],
              "responseSeconds": 10,
              "acceptedResponses": [
                "ट",
                "ट ta",
                "ट ṭa"
              ],
              "feedback": {
                "correct": "Right: ट is the curled t with no inner ring.",
                "incorrect": "Draw one loop under the headline and leave the inner ring out."
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
